#: ../../topics/domains.rst:156
msgid "C++ domain"
msgstr "C++ 域"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:159
msgid ""
"The C++ domain supports modern C++ constructs, concepts, namespaces, and "
"scopes."
msgstr "C++ 域支持现代 C++ 构造、概念、命名空间和作用域。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:183
msgid "``:cpp:class:`name```: Links to a C++ class or struct."
msgstr "``:cpp:class:`name```: 链接到 C++ 类或结构体。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:184
