msgstr "``:cpp:concept:`name```: 链接到 C++20 概念。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:188
msgid "``:cpp:enum:`name```: Links to a C++ enum."
msgstr "``:cpp:enum:`name```: 链接到 C++ 枚举。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:190
msgid "JavaScript domain"
msgstr "JavaScript 域"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:193
msgid ""
"The JavaScript domain describes client-side scripts, libraries, and "
"Node.js modules."
msgstr "JavaScript 域描述浏览器脚本、库和 Node.js 模块。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:213
msgid "``:js:func:`name```: Links to a JavaScript function."
msgstr "``:js:func:`name```: 链接到 JavaScript 函数。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:214
msgid "``:js:meth:`name```: Links to a JavaScript method."
msgstr "``:js:meth:`name```: 链接到 JavaScript 方法。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:215
msgid "``:js:class:`name```: Links to a JavaScript class."
msgstr "``:js:class:`name```: 链接到 JavaScript 类。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:216
msgid "``:js:data:`name```: Links to a JavaScript variable."
msgstr "``:js:data:`name```: 链接到 JavaScript 变量。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:217
