#: ../../topics/domains.rst:220
msgid "Rust domain"
msgstr "Rust 域"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:223
msgid "The Rust domain describes crates as rustdoc presents them. Each directive takes the declaration as Rust writes it, on one line, visibility and qualifiers included. Targets are full paths with ``::``, the crate's name first."
msgstr "Rust 域按照 rustdoc 的呈现方式描述 crate。每个指令都接受 Rust 原样写法的声明，写在一行内，包括可见性和限定符。目标是用 ``::`` 连接的完整路径，以 crate 名开头。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:258
msgid "Directives include: ``rust:crate``, ``rust:module``, ``rust:function``, ``rust:method``, ``rust:struct``, ``rust:enum``, ``rust:variant``, ``rust:union``, ``rust:trait``, ``rust:impl``, ``rust:type``, ``rust:const``, ``rust:static``, ``rust:macro``, ``rust:field``, ``rust:associatedtype``, ``rust:associatedconst``, and ``rust:use``. Options include ``:visibility:``, ``:cfg:``, ``:unsafe:``, ``:async:``, ``:const:``, ``:provided:``, ``:attributes:``, ``:deprecated:``, ``:for:``, ``:trait:``, ``:target:``, and ``:noindex:``. An ``impl`` is never a target itself. Its members belong to the type."
msgstr "指令包括：``rust:crate``、``rust:module``、``rust:function``、``rust:method``、``rust:struct``、``rust:enum``、``rust:variant``、``rust:union``、``rust:trait``、``rust:impl``、``rust:type``、``rust:const``、``rust:static``、``rust:macro``、``rust:field``、``rust:associatedtype``、``rust:associatedconst`` 和 ``rust:use``。选项包括 ``:visibility:``、``:cfg:``、``:unsafe:``、``:async:``、``:const:``、``:provided:``、``:attributes:``、``:deprecated:``、``:for:``、``:trait:``、``:target:`` 和 ``:noindex:``。``impl`` 本身从不是目标，它的成员归属于对应的类型。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:266
msgid "Guidedog can also generate these pages from a crate's source, without compiling it. See :doc:`../howto/document-code` and ``rust_autoapi_crates`` in :doc:`../reference/configuration`."
msgstr "Guidedog 也可以直接从 crate 的源码生成这些页面，无需编译。参见 :doc:`../howto/document-code`，以及 :doc:`../reference/configuration` 中的 ``rust_autoapi_crates``。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:273
msgid "``:rust:mod:`path```: Links to a crate or module."
msgstr "``:rust:mod:`path```：链接到 crate 或模块。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:274
msgid "``:rust:fn:`path```: Links to a function or method."
msgstr "``:rust:fn:`path```：链接到函数或方法。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:275
msgid "``:rust:struct:`path```, ``:rust:enum:`path```, ``:rust:union:`path```, ``:rust:trait:`path```: Link to those types."
msgstr "``:rust:struct:`path```、``:rust:enum:`path```、``:rust:union:`path```、``:rust:trait:`path```：链接到相应的类型。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:277
msgid "``:rust:variant:`path```, ``:rust:field:`path```: Link to a variant or a field."
msgstr "``:rust:variant:`path```、``:rust:field:`path```：链接到变体或字段。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:278
msgid "``:rust:type:`path```, ``:rust:const:`path```, ``:rust:static:`path```, ``:rust:macro:`path```: Link to aliases and associated types, constants, statics, and macros."
msgstr "``:rust:type:`path```、``:rust:const:`path```、``:rust:static:`path```、``:rust:macro:`path```：链接到类型别名和关联类型、常量、静态项以及宏。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:281
msgid "``:rust:any:`path```: Links to any of them, or through an inventory to another project (``std::vec::Vec``). An unresolved target is shown as code."
msgstr "``:rust:any:`path```：链接到以上任意一种，或者通过清单链接到其他项目（``std::vec::Vec``）。无法解析的目标显示为代码。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:284
msgid "Cross-referencing conventions"
msgstr "交叉引用约定"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:287
msgid "Cross-references in domains support several modifiers:"
msgstr "域中的交叉引用支持以下几种修饰符："

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:289
msgid ""
"**Hide prefix**: Prefixing the target with a tilde (``~``) displays only "
"the final component of the target name. For example, "
"``:py:func:`~pipeline.reader.DocumentReader.parse``` renders as "
"``parse()``."
msgstr ""
"**隐藏前缀** ：在目标前加 ``~``，只显示名称的最后一部分。例如 "
"``:py:func:`~pipeline.reader.DocumentReader.parse``` 显示为 ``parse()``。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:290
msgid ""
"**Current scope resolution**: Relative references look up names within "
"the active module or namespace before falling back to global lookup."
msgstr "**当前作用域** ：相对引用先在当前模块或命名空间中查找，再进行全局查找。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:291
msgid ""
"**Exact match**: Prefixing with a dot (``.``) searches from the current "
"module or enclosing object."
msgstr "**精确匹配** ：在目标前加 ``.``，从当前模块或所属对象开始查找。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:293
msgid "The Rust domain follows the same conventions with ``::`` paths: ``:rust:struct:`~my_crate::geometry::Point``` renders as ``Point``."
msgstr "Rust 域使用 ``::`` 路径，遵循同样的约定：``:rust:struct:`~my_crate::geometry::Point``` 显示为 ``Point``。"

#: ../../topics/index.rst:1
msgid "Topic guides"
msgstr "专题指南"

#: ../../topics/index.rst:4
msgid "These chapters explain the model. They give us enough context to make a choice."
msgstr "这些章节解释整体模型，为我们做出选择提供足够的背景。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:1
msgid "Mathematics and proofs"
msgstr "数学与证明"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:4
msgid ""
"An equation is useful when it makes a relation easier to inspect. Define "
"every symbol before relying on it. State the units where they matter. The "
"equation should support the explanation, not replace it."
msgstr "公式应让关系更容易检查。使用符号前先定义，必要时说明单位。公式应支持解释，而非取代解释。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:8
msgid "Inline and display mathematics"
msgstr "行内公式与独立公式"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:11
msgid ""
"Use the ``math`` role for a short expression. Use the ``math`` directive "
"for a display. Write the common LaTeX mathematics subset that both "
"targets understand."
msgstr "短公式用 ``math`` 角色，独立公式用 ``math`` 指令。使用两个目标均支持的通用 LaTeX 数学子集。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:25
msgid "A side of length :math:`s` encloses area :math:`s^2`."
msgstr "边长为 :math:`s` 的正方形，面积为 :math:`s^2`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:27
msgid "A = s^2"
msgstr "A = s^2"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:32
msgid ""
"The relation is :eq:`area-square`. Guidedog gives a labelled equation a "
"stable target. The HTML builder supplies MathJax markup. The PDF renderer "
"translates the supported LaTeX subset to Typst mathematics. An "
"unsupported PDF command is reported. Arbitrary LaTeX packages are not "
"evaluated."
msgstr ""
"关系见 :eq:`area-square`\\ 。Guidedog 为带标签公式提供稳定目标。HTML 构建器提供 MathJax 标记；PDF "
"渲染器将受支持的 LaTeX 子集转为 Typst 数学。不支持的 PDF 命令会被报告，不执行任意 LaTeX 包。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:38
msgid "A small proof"
msgstr "一个简短的证明"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:41
msgid ""
"Let :math:`U` be the bytes already charged to a budget. Let :math:`B` be "
"its limit. Let :math:`n` be a requested allocation. Assume all three "
"values are nonnegative and :math:`U \\le B`."
msgstr ""
"设 :math:`U` 为已计入预算的字节数，\\ :math:`B` 为上限，\\ :math:`n` 为申请分配量。假设三者均非负，且 "
":math:`U \\le B`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:45
msgid "**Admission rule.** Admit the request exactly when"
msgstr "**准入规则。** 当且仅当以下条件成立时，接受请求："

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:47
msgid "n \\le B - U."
msgstr "n \\le B - U."

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:52
msgid "**Claim.** An admitted request preserves :math:`U + n \\le B`."
msgstr "**命题。** 接受请求后，仍有 :math:`U + n \\le B`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Proof.** Add :math:`U` to both sides of :eq:`budget-admission`. The "
"result is :math:`U+n \\le B`. The implementation tests the subtraction "
"form. It does not first compute :math:`U+n`, which could overflow a "
"machine integer. The proof and the arithmetic order agree."
msgstr ""
"**证明。** 在 :eq:`budget-admission` 两边加 :math:`U`\\ ，得到 :math:`U+n \\le B`\\ "
"。实现检查减法形式，不先计算可能使机器整数溢出的 :math:`U+n`\\ 。证明与运算顺序一致。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:59
msgid "**Boundary.** This accounts for charged host storage. It does not bound the Typst compiler's internal allocations. A proof is only as strong as the boundary it states."
msgstr "**边界。** 这里只计入已核算的宿主存储，并不限制 Typst 编译器的内部分配。证明的效力取决于它所声明的边界。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:63
msgid "HTML setup"
msgstr "HTML 设置"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:66
msgid ""
"These projects bundle MathJax 3.2.2 with its SVG font data. The bundle is "
"loaded only on pages containing mathematics. It makes these pages "
"readable offline after a build. No diagram script or web font service is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"这些项目随附 MathJax 3.2.2 及 SVG 字体数据，仅在含数学公式的页面加载。构建后离线也可阅读，无需图示脚本或网络字体服务。"

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:71
msgid "For our own projects, the default uses MathJax from a CDN. To serve a local copy, we place it in ``_static`` and set:"
msgstr "在我们自己的项目中，默认从 CDN 加载 MathJax。要使用本地副本，把它放进 ``_static``，然后设置："

#: ../../topics/mathematics.rst:79
msgid ""
"JavaScript is needed here to typeset web equations. Without it, their "
"source remains visible. PDF equations do not need browser JavaScript. See "
"the `MathJax component contract "
"<https://docs.mathjax.org/en/v3.2/web/components/combined.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Web 公式需要 JavaScript 排版；关闭时仍显示源文。PDF 公式不依赖浏览器 JavaScript。见 `MathJax 组件契约 "
"<https://docs.mathjax.org/en/v3.2/web/components/combined.html>`_\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:1
msgid "How a project works"
msgstr "项目如何工作"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:4
msgid ""
"The project root is the directory containing ``conf.toml``. ``root_doc`` "
"names the document that starts the reading order. Guidedog discovers "
"source documents, reads them, resolves their relations, and publishes a "
"complete output generation."
msgstr ""
"项目根目录是包含 ``conf.toml`` 的目录。\\ ``root_doc`` 指定阅读顺序起点。Guidedog "
"发现并读取源文档、解析关系，发布完整输出版本。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:11
msgid ""
"Pipeline traverses discovery, source plugins, parallel reading, reference "
"resolution, rendering, HTML plugins, and atomic staging."
msgstr "流程从发现源文件开始，经源插件、并行读取、引用解析、渲染和 HTML 插件，最后暂存并提交完整输出。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:11
msgid "Guidedog's end-to-end documentation compilation pipeline."
msgstr "Guidedog 端到端文档编译流程。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:35
msgid "Documents and resources"
msgstr "文档与资源"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:38
msgid ""
"A source suffix selects a reader. RST and project Markdown share the "
"project graph. Images and downloads are resources. Guidedog copies "
"resources that the documents use. Theme assets are listed in "
"``html_static_path``. An include must remain within the source directory "
"or the configured ``include_roots``."
msgstr ""
"文件后缀选择读取器。RST 和项目 Markdown 共享项目图。图片和下载是资源；Guidedog 复制文档使用的资源。主题资源列于 "
"``html_static_path``\\ 。包含文件必须位于源目录或配置的 ``include_roots`` 内。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:43
msgid "Separate projects"
msgstr "独立的项目"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:46
msgid "We keep a manual and design records in separate projects. They have different readers and different reading orders. Each project has its own configuration, templates, cache, and output. The Guidedog repository uses ``docs/manual`` and ``docs/gds`` this way."
msgstr "我们把手册和设计记录放在不同的项目中，因为它们的读者和阅读顺序都不一样。每个项目都有自己的配置、模板、缓存和输出。Guidedog 仓库中的 ``docs/manual`` 和 ``docs/gds`` 就是这样组织的。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:51
msgid "Incremental work"
msgstr "增量构建"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:54
msgid ""
"Guidedog records the inputs and lookups used by each output. A changed "
"source is reread. A changed dependency invalidates its users. A changed "
"template can affect every page. An unchanged document may be loaded from "
"its saved object."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 记录各输出使用的输入和查找结果。源文件改变会重读，依赖改变使使用者失效，模板改变可影响每页。未变文档可从保存对象加载。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:59
msgid ""
"The cache is evidence about a previous build. It is not the source of "
"truth. ``-E`` discards the saved environment for the next build. ``-a`` "
"writes all outputs. They solve different problems."
msgstr ""
"缓存是上次构建的证据，不是事实来源。\\ ``-E`` 丢弃下次构建使用的保存环境，\\ ``-a`` 写出所有输出。它们解决不同问题。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:63
msgid ""
"\\text{reuse} = \\text{same inputs} \\land \\text{same lookups} \\land "
"\\text{output exists}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{可复用} = \\text{输入相同} \\land \\text{查找结果相同} \\land \\text{输出存在}"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:67
msgid "An explicit timestamp in a template is also an input to the rendered page. A page that prints the current minute can change even when its prose does not. We use ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` when we need a fixed build time."
msgstr "模板中显式写入的时间戳也是渲染页面的输入。打印当前分钟的页面，即使正文没变也可能发生变化。需要固定的构建时间时，我们使用 ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH``。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:71
msgid "Publication"
msgstr "发布"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:74
msgid ""
"A build writes changes to a sibling staging directory. It completes that "
"directory, flushes the files and records, and then switches generations. "
"Readers see a complete previous or new publication. An interrupted commit "
"is settled on the next build. The design and its proof obligations are in "
":doc:`../internals/publication`."
msgstr ""
"构建将变化写入同级暂存目录，完成目录、刷写文件和记录后，再切换版本。读者看到完整旧版或新版。中断的提交在下次构建处理。设计和证明义务见 "
":doc:`../internals/publication`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:1
msgid "Typography for reading"
msgstr "适合阅读的排版"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:4
msgid ""
"A page should make its structure visible before the reader studies it. A "
"strong title, a quiet navigation column, and a measured text column do "
"most of the work. Color should mark a relation or an action. It should "
"not carry the meaning alone."
msgstr "页面应在细读之前展示结构。醒目的标题、安静的导航栏和适度宽的正文栏已能完成大部分工作。颜色应标明关系或操作，不独自承担含义。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:8
msgid "The web page"
msgstr "网页"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:11
msgid ""
"The custom layout has three regions: project navigation, the document, "
"and the current page's outline. Small screens use a navigation drawer. "
"The reading edition bundles Libertinus Serif and Libertinus Sans. Titles "
"use a bold serif face. Navigation, labels, and controls use its sans "
"companion. The compressed WOFF2 files are served with the site. There are "
"no font-service requests."
msgstr ""
"自定义布局分为项目导航、正文和当前页面纲要三部分，小屏使用导航抽屉。阅读版随附 Libertinus Serif 和 Libertinus "
"Sans。标题用粗体衬线字；导航、标签和控件用配套无衬线字。压缩 WOFF2 文件随站点提供，不请求字体服务。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:20
msgid ""
"Navigation column on left, main document text column in center, local "
"section outline on right."
msgstr "左侧为项目导航，中间为正文，右侧为本页标题提纲。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:20
msgid "Three-region reading layout for HTML documentation."
msgstr "HTML 文档的三栏阅读布局。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Light is the default.** The theme control also offers dark and system "
"modes. It remembers the choice on the same browser origin. System mode "
"follows the operating system. Printed HTML uses light colors. Content and "
"navigation remain usable without JavaScript. The theme control and "
"enhanced search are progressive enhancements."
msgstr ""
"**默认浅色。** 主题控件也提供深色和系统模式，并记住同一浏览器来源上的选择。系统模式跟随操作系统。打印 HTML 使用浅色。禁用 "
"JavaScript 后，内容和导航仍可用；主题控件与增强搜索属于渐进增强。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:43
msgid ""
"English prose can use paragraph-wide **Knuth-Plass line breaking** in the "
"browser. A small template script measures the loaded font, builds boxes, "
"spaces, and hyphenation penalties, and chooses breaks for the whole "
"paragraph. Frank Liang's pattern method supplies English hyphenation "
"candidates. The original TeX patterns and the libraries' licenses are "
"bundled with the site."
msgstr ""
"英文正文可在浏览器中使用整段 **Knuth-Plass "
"断行**。小型模板脚本测量已加载的字体，构造盒子、空格和断词惩罚，再为整段选择换行点。Frank Liang "
"的模式匹配法提供英文断词候选。网站附带原始 TeX 模式和各库许可证。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:49
msgid ""
"The enhancement preserves emphasis and the exact source text. It "
"recalculates when the reading measure changes. Copying within one "
"optimized paragraph gives the source text, without visual line divisions "
"or added hyphens. Printing restores the ordinary paragraph so the print "
"layout can paginate it."
msgstr ""
"增强排版保留强调和原始文字，正文宽度改变时重新计算。复制一个优化段落内的内容，得到的是源文，不含视觉换行或新增连字符。打印时恢复普通段落，交由打印布局分页。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:54
msgid "Links, mathematics, code, interactive content, narrow measures, and other languages use native browser layout. So do paragraphs for which no suitably spaced solution exists. The site remains readable with JavaScript disabled. The fallback uses language-aware ``hyphens: auto`` and ``text-wrap: pretty``. Those CSS properties alone are not a promise of Knuth-Plass optimization."
msgstr "链接、公式、代码、交互内容、窄栏以及其他语言使用浏览器原生排版；找不到合适间距方案的段落也是如此。禁用 JavaScript 后网站依然可读。回退方案使用按语言生效的 ``hyphens: auto`` 和 ``text-wrap: pretty``。仅靠这两个 CSS 属性，并不能保证 Knuth-Plass 优化。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:60
msgid "The PDF page"
msgstr "PDF 页面"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:63
msgid ""
"The book template uses the same Libertinus family as the web edition. It "
"sets justified paragraphs, optimized line breaking, and language-aware "
"hyphenation. It also controls spacing, running heads, captions, code "
"blocks, and table rules. The font, hyphenation cost, and paragraph "
"measure work together. A forced line break is rarely the right repair for "
"a loose paragraph."
msgstr ""
"书籍模板使用与 Web 相同的 Libertinus "
"字体，设置两端对齐、优化断行和语言感知断词，也控制间距、页眉、题注、代码块和表格线。字体、断词成本与段落宽度共同作用。强制换行通常不能正确修复松散段落。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:69
msgid ""
"Typst optimizes the PDF paragraphs. The web enhancement optimizes "
"eligible prose. They share the source, fonts, and visual hierarchy. Their "
"line breaks can differ. See the `Typst text contract "
"<https://typst.app/docs/reference/text/text/>`_ and the `browser "
"hyphenation contract "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/hyphens>`_."
msgstr ""
"Typst 优化 PDF 段落，Web 增强优化适用正文。它们共享源文、字体和视觉层级，但断行可能不同。见 `Typst 文本契约 "
"<https://typst.app/docs/reference/text/text/>`_ 和 `浏览器断词契约 "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/hyphens>`_\\ "
"。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:74
msgid "Change the design"
msgstr "修改设计"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:77
msgid ""
"Edit ``_static/editorial.css`` for the documentation project's visual "
"tokens. Edit ``_templates/layout.html`` for structure. Edit "
"``_templates/book.typ`` for the print layout. Keep reading order, focus "
"indicators, labels, and sufficient contrast intact."
msgstr ""
"编辑 ``_static/editorial.css`` 调整视觉变量，编辑 ``_templates/layout.html`` 调整结构，编辑 "
"``_templates/book.typ`` 调整印刷布局。保留阅读顺序、焦点指示、标签和足够对比度。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:82
msgid "Build both targets after a change. Inspect a page with code, a table, a diagram, and an equation. An attractive cover is not proof that the rest of the book works. We build our own design in :doc:`../tutorial/a-custom-theme`. The full template contract is in :doc:`../templates`. The Rust API of Guidedog's crates is documented in the separate ``docs/api`` project."
msgstr "修改后要同时构建两种输出。检查一个包含代码、表格、图示和公式的页面。封面漂亮，并不说明书的其余部分没有问题。我们在 :doc:`../tutorial/a-custom-theme` 中构建自己的设计。完整的模板契约见 :doc:`../templates`。Guidedog 各 crate 的 Rust API 在独立的 ``docs/api`` 项目中提供文档。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:1
msgid "Authoring documents"
msgstr "编写文档"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:4
msgid "Guidedog supports both reStructuredText (``.rst``) and MyST Markdown (``.md``). Both are parsed into the same document tree. The HTML website and the PDF book are made from that tree."
msgstr "Guidedog 同时支持 reStructuredText（``.rst``）和 MyST Markdown（``.md``）。两者都解析为同一种文档树，HTML 网站和 PDF 书籍都由这棵树生成。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:8
msgid "Choose a source language"
msgstr "选择源文件语言"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:11
msgid "We use reStructuredText when we need full access to domains, complex tables, and extensible directives. We use MyST Markdown when we prefer Markdown syntax but still want Sphinx-style directives and roles."
msgstr "需要完整使用域、复杂表格和可扩展的指令时，我们使用 reStructuredText。更喜欢 Markdown 语法、同时又想使用 Sphinx 风格的指令和角色时，我们使用 MyST Markdown。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:15
msgid "In a documentation project, Markdown documents are parsed as MyST. Single-document conversions with ``guidedog convert`` read Markdown as plain CommonMark 0.31.2: MyST's directives, roles, and settings belong to projects."
msgstr "在文档项目中，Markdown 文档按 MyST 解析。使用 ``guidedog convert`` 转换单个文档时，Markdown 按纯 CommonMark 0.31.2 读取：MyST 的指令、角色和设置只属于项目。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:19
msgid "Headings and structure"
msgstr "标题与结构"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:22
msgid "A document title identifies the page. Sections and subsections divide the text. In reStructuredText, headings use underline adornments (and optional matching overlines). The underline must be at least as long as the text."
msgstr "文档标题标识页面，章节和小节划分正文。在 reStructuredText 中，标题使用下划线装饰（也可以加上相同的上划线）。下划线的长度不能短于标题文字。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:26
msgid "Recommended adornment styles:"
msgstr "建议的标题符号："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:45
msgid "We keep heading levels consistent across the project. In MyST Markdown, we use standard hashes (``#``, ``##``, ``###``)."
msgstr "我们在整个项目中保持标题层级一致。在 MyST Markdown 中，使用标准的井号（``#``、``##``、``###``）。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:48
msgid "Text formatting and inline markup"
msgstr "文字格式与行内标记"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:51
msgid "Inline markup carries meaning, not decoration:"
msgstr "行内标记表达的是含义，而不是装饰："

