msgstr "要在正文中写出字面的星号或反引号，用反斜杠转义：``\\*not italic\\*``。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:79
msgid "Lists"
msgstr "列表"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:82
msgid "Guidedog supports four kinds of lists:"
msgstr "Guidedog 支持四种列表："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:84
msgid "Bullet lists"
msgstr "无序列表"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:94
msgid "Enumerated lists"
msgstr "有序列表"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:104
msgid "Definition lists"
msgstr "定义列表"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:107
msgid "A definition list pairs terms with explanations. The term stands on one line. An indented definition follows it directly:"
msgstr "定义列表把术语和说明配成对。术语单独占一行，缩进的定义紧随其后："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:118
msgid "Field lists"
msgstr "字段列表"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:121
msgid "Field lists provide structured metadata and parameter descriptions:"
msgstr "字段列表用于结构化元数据和参数说明："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:129
msgid "Code blocks"
msgstr "代码块"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:132
msgid "The ``code-block`` directive (or ``sourcecode``) shows syntax-highlighted code. Guidedog highlights 35 programming languages, Rust and Odin among them, with Pygments' names and styles and no Python runtime:"
msgstr "``code-block`` 指令（或 ``sourcecode``）显示带语法高亮的代码。Guidedog 能高亮 35 种编程语言，其中包括 Rust 和 Odin，使用 Pygments 的名称和样式，且无需 Python 运行时："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:147
msgid "Options for code blocks:"
msgstr "代码块选项："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:149
msgid "``:linenos:``: Displays line numbers beside the code."
msgstr "``:linenos:``: 在代码旁显示行号。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:150
msgid "``:caption: Title``: Adds a caption above or below the code block."
msgstr "``:caption: Title``: 在代码块上方或下方添加说明。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:151
msgid "``:emphasize-lines: 1, 3-5``: Highlights specific lines."
msgstr "``:emphasize-lines: 1, 3-5``: 突出显示指定行。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:152
msgid "``:name: label``: Assigns a reference target to the code block."
msgstr "``:name: label``: 为代码块指定引用标签。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:154
msgid "To include source code from a file, we use ``literalinclude``:"
msgstr "要从文件中引入源代码，我们使用 ``literalinclude``："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:163
msgid "Admonitions"
msgstr "提示块"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:166
msgid "Admonitions highlight notes, warnings, and supplementary advice:"
msgstr "提示块突出显示注释、警告和补充建议："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:188
msgid ""
"Guidedog also supports ``danger``, ``error``, ``hint``, and "
"``attention``. A generic admonition with a custom title uses the "
"``admonition`` directive:"
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 也支持 ``danger``、``error``、``hint`` 和 ``attention``。自定义标题的提示块使用 "
"``admonition``："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:197
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:200
msgid ""
"Guidedog supports simple tables, grid tables, and directive-based tables."
msgstr "Guidedog 支持简单表格、网格表格和指令生成的表格。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:202
msgid "Simple tables"
msgstr "简单表格"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:205
msgid "Simple tables use horizontal dashes to define column spans:"
msgstr "简单表格用横线划分列的范围："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:217
msgid "Grid tables"
msgstr "网格表格"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:220
msgid ""
"Grid tables allow complex multi-line cells and arbitrary column/row spans:"
msgstr "网格表格支持多行单元格和跨行、跨列合并："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:231
msgid "List tables"
msgstr "列表表格"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:234
msgid "The ``list-table`` directive creates tables from nested bullet lists. Wide tables stay easy to read and maintain in source control:"
msgstr "``list-table`` 指令用嵌套的无序列表创建表格。即使是较宽的表格，在源码中也便于阅读和维护："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:253
msgid "CSV tables"
msgstr "CSV 表格"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:256
msgid ""
"The ``csv-table`` directive constructs a table from comma-separated "
"values:"
msgstr "``csv-table`` 用逗号分隔的数据创建表格："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:267
msgid "Images and figures"
msgstr "图片与插图"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:270
msgid "We include illustrations, screenshots, and diagrams with ``image`` and ``figure``:"
msgstr "我们用 ``image`` 和 ``figure`` 插入插图、截图和图表："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:286
msgid "A ``figure`` wraps the image with a caption and an optional reference target."
msgstr "``figure`` 为图片加上图注，还可以指定引用目标。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:288
msgid "Document structure with toctrees"
msgstr "用目录树组织文档"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:291
msgid ""
"The ``toctree`` directive creates the document hierarchy, navigation "
"menus, and reading order for both the HTML site and the PDF book:"
msgstr "``toctree`` 定义文档层级、导航菜单，以及 HTML 和 PDF 的阅读顺序："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:305
msgid "Common options for ``toctree``:"
msgstr "``toctree`` 的常用选项："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:307
msgid ""
"``:maxdepth: N``: Depth of heading levels to include in the table of "
"contents."
msgstr "``:maxdepth: N``: 目录中包含的标题层级深度。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:308
msgid ""
"``:caption: Title``: Category title displayed above the navigation "
"entries."
msgstr "``:caption: Title``: 导航条目上方显示的分类标题。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:309
msgid "``:numbered:``: Adds section numbers to chapters and headings."
msgstr "``:numbered:``: 为章节和标题添加编号。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:310
msgid ""
"``:titlesonly:``: Lists only the top-level document titles, ignoring "
"inner sections."
msgstr "``:titlesonly:``: 只列出文档标题，不显示内部章节。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:311
msgid ""
"``:hidden:``: Records the documents in the reading order without "
"rendering an inline list."
msgstr "``:hidden:``: 记录文档阅读顺序，但不在正文中显示列表。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:312
msgid ""
"``:glob:``: Allows wildcard patterns to match documents (e.g. "
"``tutorials/*``)."
msgstr "``:glob:``: 允许用通配符匹配文档，例如 ``tutorials/*``。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:314
msgid "Cross-references and links"
msgstr "交叉引用与链接"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:317
msgid "Explicit targets keep links stable, even when document files are renamed."
msgstr "显式目标让链接保持稳定，即使文档文件改名也不受影响。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:319
msgid "Target labels and ``:ref:``"
msgstr "目标标签与 ``:ref:``"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:322
msgid "We place a target label directly before a heading, table, or figure:"
msgstr "我们把目标标签直接放在标题、表格或插图之前："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:333
msgid "Any document in the project can refer to this target:"
msgstr "项目中的任何文档都可以引用这个目标："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:340
msgid "Document references with ``:doc:``"
msgstr "用 ``:doc:`` 引用文档"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:343
msgid "We link to another document by its path, without the file extension:"
msgstr "我们按路径链接到其他文档，省略文件扩展名："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:349
msgid "Glossary terms with ``:term:``"
msgstr "用 ``:term:`` 引用术语"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:352
msgid "We define terms with the ``glossary`` directive:"
msgstr "我们用 ``glossary`` 指令定义术语："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:364
msgid "We link to a glossary term with the ``:term:`` role:"
msgstr "我们用 ``:term:`` 角色链接到术语表中的术语："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:370
msgid "File downloads with ``:download:``"
msgstr "用 ``:download:`` 提供文件下载"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:373
msgid "This copies a file to the output's download directory and links to it:"
msgstr "下面的写法会把文件复制到输出的下载目录，并生成指向它的链接："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:379
msgid "External links"
msgstr "外部链接"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:382
msgid "We link to external web addresses like this:"
msgstr "链接到外部网址的写法如下："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:388
msgid "Substitutions and includes"
msgstr "替换与包含"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:391
msgid "We define reusable phrases, symbols, or images:"
msgstr "我们可以定义可复用的短语、符号或图片："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:400
msgid "To reuse reStructuredText content in several files:"
msgstr "要在多个文件中复用 reStructuredText 内容："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:406
msgid "MyST Markdown authoring"
msgstr "编写 MyST Markdown"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:409
msgid "MyST Markdown supports the same directives and roles through fenced blocks:"
msgstr "MyST Markdown 通过围栏块支持相同的指令和角色："

